{"4709420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HACKING INTO EREBUS", "steam_appid": 4709420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5046310], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HACKING INTO EREBUS</strong> is a terminal-driven cyberpunk hacking thriller where you jack into a ship's network, manipulate ARIA under constant surveillance and unearth the secrets they'd kill to keep buried. Every system is a target. Every command leaves a trace. Extract what you need, complete your missions and claw your way toward the truth before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every System Is Wired</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ISS Erebus is a living, breathing network. Power grids, life support, navigation, crew quarters. All tangled together in one exploitable web. Nothing runs independent. Nothing is off-limits. Every command you send ripples through the grid and every ripple can be traced back to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Arsenal Built From the System Itself</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/36e8a42e6ad73caac06b889327f599be.poster.avif?t=1787773480\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/36e8a42e6ad73caac06b889327f599be.webm?t=1787773480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/36e8a42e6ad73caac06b889327f599be.mp4?t=1787773480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyloggers, signal jammers, memory corruptors, power rerouters. The Erebus's own infrastructure becomes your weapon against it. Every tool interacts with the ship's systems in a different way. Learn what breaks what, exploit every backdoor and remember: The network doesn't forgive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ship Is Watching Back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is hiding aboard the Erebus. The crew  will fight to keep you out. Distract them. Mislead them. Sabotage their systems to create openings by using your code skills through terminal. Infiltrate deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/5a1b5f4ec331477a03838107b61df891.poster.avif?t=1787773480\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/5a1b5f4ec331477a03838107b61df891.webm?t=1787773480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/5a1b5f4ec331477a03838107b61df891.mp4?t=1787773480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compartment Zero</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every lead, every stolen file, every cracked system points to the same place. A section of the ship with no records. And yet it's there. What's locked inside Compartment Zero will rewrite everything you thought you knew. What you do with it once you're in is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/2ecc2270a15b4f0a30d8092e60cd8cc1.avif?t=1787773480\" width=1292 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Our Discord and Steer The Ship With Us</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come hang out with us! Drop your bug reports, tell us what you'd love to see in the game and let us know what's working or not. We are building Erebus together with you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HACKING INTO EREBUS</strong> is a terminal-driven cyberpunk hacking thriller where you jack into a ship's network, manipulate ARIA under constant surveillance and unearth the secrets they'd kill to keep buried. Every system is a target. Every command leaves a trace. Extract what you need, complete your missions and claw your way toward the truth before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every System Is Wired</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ISS Erebus is a living, breathing network. Power grids, life support, navigation, crew quarters. All tangled together in one exploitable web. Nothing runs independent. Nothing is off-limits. Every command you send ripples through the grid and every ripple can be traced back to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Arsenal Built From the System Itself</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/36e8a42e6ad73caac06b889327f599be.poster.avif?t=1787773480\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/36e8a42e6ad73caac06b889327f599be.webm?t=1787773480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/36e8a42e6ad73caac06b889327f599be.mp4?t=1787773480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyloggers, signal jammers, memory corruptors, power rerouters. The Erebus's own infrastructure becomes your weapon against it. Every tool interacts with the ship's systems in a different way. Learn what breaks what, exploit every backdoor and remember: The network doesn't forgive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ship Is Watching Back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is hiding aboard the Erebus. The crew  will fight to keep you out. Distract them. Mislead them. Sabotage their systems to create openings by using your code skills through terminal. Infiltrate deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/5a1b5f4ec331477a03838107b61df891.poster.avif?t=1787773480\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/5a1b5f4ec331477a03838107b61df891.webm?t=1787773480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/5a1b5f4ec331477a03838107b61df891.mp4?t=1787773480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compartment Zero</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every lead, every stolen file, every cracked system points to the same place. A section of the ship with no records. And yet it's there. What's locked inside Compartment Zero will rewrite everything you thought you knew. What you do with it once you're in is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/extras/2ecc2270a15b4f0a30d8092e60cd8cc1.avif?t=1787773480\" width=1292 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Our Discord and Steer The Ship With Us</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come hang out with us! Drop your bug reports, tell us what you'd love to see in the game and let us know what's working or not. We are building Erebus together with you.</p>", "short_description": "HACKING INTO EREBUS is a terminal-driven hacking cyberpunk thriller. Jack into a hostile network and outsmart ARIA, a surveillance system that watches your every move. Breach nodes, override defenses and pry secrets from a crew trapped in cryosleep. Fight your way into Compartment Zero.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Italian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Korean, Polish, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/9c02f682e73ae9b04712af9f51da04f19db8ad7a/header.jpg?t=1787773480", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/4027c69b667ee73a89dfc856a899975f11d0c006/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787773480", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709420/4027c69b667ee73a89dfc856a899975f11d0c006/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787773480", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any dedicated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers